OL,3,GNEWSAWorld Conker Champ shares his
OL,4,Asecrets to success
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reigning World Conker Champion has
OL,7,Frevealed the secrets behind his success
OL,8,Fas he prepares to defend his title.
OL,10,FMatt Cross, from Bourne in
OL,11,FLincolnshire, said a combination of
OL,12,Frunning, hog roasts and pints of beer
OL,13,Fhave helped him stay at the top of his
OL,14,Fgame ahead of Sunday's competition in
OL,15,FNorthamptonshire.
OL,17,FThe champion said he hoped to be the
OL,18,Ffirst person to win the title
OL,19,Fback-to-back since 1976.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
